node_modules
dist
*.local
*.tsbuildinfo

# The repo root ignores `*.png` wholesale (.gitignore:44). Two sets here are not
# incidental screenshots and must be tracked:
#   - src-tauri/icons/*.png  — build INPUTS. tauri.conf.json's `bundle.icon` names
#     32x32.png / 128x128.png / 128x128@2x.png, so a clean checkout cannot bundle the
#     app without them. (trench-client has this same gap; its PNG icons are untracked.)
#   - docs/*.png             — the run evidence a task report points at, which is
#     worthless if it only exists on the machine that produced it.
# A negation works here because the root pattern excludes FILES (`*.png`), not a parent
# directory — git cannot re-include a file underneath an excluded directory.
!src-tauri/icons/*.png
!docs/*.png
